\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11566226\charrsid15081393 \'ec }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 
