\par b/ \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f h\'e0nh ch\'ednh s\u7921\'3f nghi}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11566226\charrsid15081393 \u7879\'3fp:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11566226\charrsid15081393 Qu\u7929\'3f l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc chi ph\u7843\'3fi ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi h\u7841\'3fn m\u7913\'3fc kinh ph\'ed \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft c\u7845
\'3fp cho m\u7909\'3fc ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng.
\par c/ \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi ti\u7873\'3fn c\'f4ng c\u7911\'3fa s\u7889\'3f lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng thu\'ea ngo\'e0i:
\par Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'f3 nhu c\u7847\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi thu\'ea lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng ngo\'e0i l\u7921\'3fc l\'fd\u7907\'3fng lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean hi\u7879\'3fn c\'f3, ti\u7873\'3fn c\'f4ng c\u7911\'3fa s\u7889\'3f
 lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng n\'e0y ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh to\'e1n vo\'e0 m\u7913\'3fc chi ph\'ed ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm ho\u7863\'3fc qu\u7929\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng k
\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\'e0 h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o gi\'e1 th\'e0nh s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm.
