\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng:
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft c\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp: t\'ednh qu\u7929\'3f l\'fd\'f5ng theo m\u7897\'3ft ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft tr\'ean t\u7893\'3fng kh\u7889\'3fi l\'fd\u7907\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn xu
\u7845\'3ft c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f bao g\u7891\'3fm: S\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ch\'ednh (ph\u7847\'3fn Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc c\'e2n \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd v\'e0 ph\u7847\'3fn \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f  t\u7921\'3f c\'e2n \'f0\u7889
\'3fi), s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ph\u7909\'3f v\'e0 c\'e1c d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f kh\'e1c.
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi XDCB, ch\u7881\'3f t\'ednh tr\'ean kh\u7889\'3fi l\'fd\u7907\'3fng ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi ngu\u7891\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd c\u7911\'3fa k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch 1987, bao g\u7891\'3fm v\u7889\'3fn c\u7911\'3f
a Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Trung \'fd\'f5ng, v\u7889\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 v\u7889\'3fn t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f; kh\'f4ng bao g\u7891\'3fm ph\u7847\'3fn kh\u7889\'3fi l\'fd\u7907\'3fng v
\'fd\u7907\'3ft l\'ean m\'e0 kh\'f4ng c\'f3 ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n.
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c ng\'e0nh n\'f4ng l\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp, ph\'e2n nu\'f4i tr\u7891\'3fng m\u7899\'3fi v\'e0 ch\'e3m s\'f3c ki\u7871\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn l\u7845\'3fy t\u7915\'3f ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7847
\'3fu t\'fd, c\u361\'3fng \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng c\'e1ch t\'ednh t\'fd\'f5ng t\u7921\'3f nh\'fd \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn.
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi ng\'e0nh th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, cung \u7913\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh qu\u7929\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng theo \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc bi\'ean ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy
\u7879\'3ft v\u7899\'3fi doanh s\u7889\'3f theo gi\'e1 k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch \'f0\u7847\'3fu n\'e3m 1987, lo\u7841\'3fi tr\u7915\'3f y\u7871\'3fu t\u7889\'3f thay \'f0\u7893\'3fi gi\'e1 mua c\'e1c th\u7901\'3fi k\u7923\'3f trong n\'e3m.
\par Ng\'e0nh \'e3n u\u7889\'3fng c\'f4ng c\u7897\'3fng v\'e0 d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f, t\'ednh qu\u7929\'3f l\'fd\'f5ng tr\'ean thu nh\u7853\'3fp r}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11566226\charrsid15081393 \'f2}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 
